 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "How the type is detected (analyze/classify.py)",
   "items": [
    "SIGNALS :25: 'Facility Agreement', 'the Borrower', 'Event of Default' = loan agreement",
    "'has been sanctioned', 'Dear Sir' = sanction letter; 'Amendment to ... Agreement' = amendment",
    "'Balance Sheet as at' = statement; 'Compliance Certificate', UDIN = certificate",
    "rule_scores :134 scores pages 1-2; decide_rules :193 needs 0.8 and a 0.3 lead, else the agent (:238)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Skill picked per type (skills/runner.py:608)",
   "items": [
    "LOAN_AGREEMENT -> covenants; SANCTION_LETTER -> sanction; AMENDMENT -> amendment_diff",
    "Each pack: pack.yaml (tools, 4 x 25 pages, 8 tool calls, 400k tokens), prompt.md, schema.json, rules.py",
    "Other job types: skills/__init__.py:80 for_job_type"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Other flows, same queue and extraction",
   "items": [
    "Amendment: skills/amendment_diff/rules.py:56 ADD / CHANGE / DELETE; :145 amended_set",
    "Statement: flows/statement.py:133 lines + derived totals; catalog.py:65 lines not found",
    "Agreement intake: flows/intake.py:70; certificate: skills/certificate/"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "The 6 agent tools (agent/document_agent.py)",
   "items": [
    ":145 page_text, :162 search_text, :182 find_definition: read this document",
    ":201 covenant_library, :224 validate_formula, :243 lookup_identifier: Spring Java rules",
    "Checks after the agent: ledger.py:228 review_items, runner.py:116 verify_with_spring"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Schemas: where each one is used",
   "items": [
    "Caller schema job-request.json: checked in step 1 (api/jobs.py:166 validate_job)",
    "Page model schema: the output of step 3 (parse/page_model.py:30)",
    "Skill answer schema: checked in step 8 (agent/document_agent.py:293)",
    "Extraction schema result.json:82: saved in step 9 (skills/runner.py:557), pulled by Spring",
    "DB schema models.py: 25 tables; row 10 shows the main ones; Alembic in dps/migrations/versions/"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Safety",
   "items": [
    "Parsing in a no-network sandbox; OCR local; only selected pages go to the bank's Azure",
    "Every AI value must quote its page; the ledger accounts for every duty sentence",
    "Spring down: SPRING_UNAVAILABLE, field to review, job continues; DPS never decides compliance"
   ]
